# Pinned upstream artifacts shipped inside the Cucina host package (R-MAC-8, §0.5 "pin everything").
# Plain KEY=value lines (no shell expansion): read by scripts/lib.sh and mirrored in deps.MODULE.bazel.
# Update both files together; scripts/fetch-deps.sh verifies every SHA-256 before anything is staged.

# Tart (FSL-1.1-ALv2), official release tarball (contains tart.app + LICENSE). Shipped exactly as released and
# NEVER re-signed: re-signing drops its restricted com.apple.vm.networking entitlement.
